# Media-index working data (scripts/media-index/ output).
# Never commit this tree — this repo is PUBLIC and the tree contains:
#   - Dropbox share URLs with live `rlkey` access tokens for Miles's client
#     deliverables (103 occurrences at last count)
#   - copies of client brand-guide PDFs
#   - extracted keyframes of identifiable people (model-release status unknown)
# It's also ~92 MB of derived output that's reproducible from the scripts.
# Leading slash matters: an unanchored `media-index/` would also swallow
# `scripts/media-index/`, which is the tooling and does belong in the repo.
/media-index/
